<title>CHINA: China finds new 50 mln T oil reserves in Xinjiang.</title>
<headline>China finds new 50 mln T oil reserves in Xinjiang.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has found new reserves of 50 million tonnes of oil in the Jungar basin in northwest China, the Xinjiang Daily said in an edition seen in Beijing on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new oilfield in Xinjiang region covered an estimated 51 square km (20 square miles), the newspaper said but gave no further details.</p>
</text>
